  id: spell-guidance
  displayName: Guidance
  description: You touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one ability check of its choice. It can roll the die before or after making the ability check. The spell then ends. (No ability-check system exists yet to hook this into -- authored as a zero-effect utility spell, same as Light/Thaumaturgy.)
